#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:12
#: f7accc6ed41c410a8569df2aee7f1398
msgid ""
"This mode is for advanced users and provides a means to characterize the "
"response of a vehicle in the frequency domain.  The flight data collected "
"from this mode can be used in several ways:"
msgstr "此模式供高级用户使用，提供在频域中表征飞行器响应特性的方法。从此模式采集的飞行数据可用于以下几个方面："

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:14
#: 0fc81969431e48c88f5e155650a30007
msgid ""
"generating mathematical models of the vehicles flight behavior for model "
"generation"
msgstr "生成飞行器飞行行为的数学模型"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:15
#: 51b326c94f324f469518a92d80777d7a
msgid "investigating and predicting the quality of the vehicle tune"
msgstr "评估和预测飞行器调参质量"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:16
#: 43a0b4152617478fb4b4f3427ad3e7bb
msgid "calculating flying quality metrics"
msgstr "计算飞行品质指标"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:18
#: 4c4aec514bbc432994370c2837489cc9
msgid ""
"It injects an input signal, called a chirp, at various points in the control"
" loops.  The chirp is a constant amplitude oscillation that increases in "
"frequency from a user defined minimum to maximum frequency, generally "
"referred to as a frequency sweep.  The injection points are defined by the "
":ref:`SID_AXIS<SID_AXIS>` parameter and there are points in the Attitude and"
" Position Controller.  For any injection points in the Attitude Controller, "
"the user is required to fly the aircraft through an underlying STABILIZE "
"like flight mode.  For any injection points in the Position Controller, the "
"user controls are locked out and will not be able to affect the control of "
"the vehicle.  The resulting flight data is logged for math analysis and "
"model generation after the flight."
msgstr ""
"该模式在控制环路的各个点注入称为 chirp 的输入信号。chirp "
"是一种幅值恒定、频率从用户定义的最小值扫描至最大值的振荡信号，通常称为频率扫描。注入点由 :ref:`SID_AXIS<SID_AXIS>` "
"参数定义，可在姿态控制器和位置控制器中设置。对于姿态控制器中的注入点，用户需在类似 Stabilize "
"的底层飞行模式下飞行。对于位置控制器中的注入点，用户控制将被锁定，无法影响飞行器的控制。生成的飞行数据将被记录，用于飞行后的数学分析和模型生成。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:22
#: 432b5fee89634250b2a58f4b8abf5b25
msgid "Enabling the Mode"
msgstr "启用该模式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-systemid-mode.rst:24
#: a0101e38d5f24e298b425c5340955c7d
msgid ""
"If the :ref:`SID_AXIS<SID_AXIS>` is non-zero, then this modes associated "
"parameters will become visible on the next parameter refresh and entry into "
"the mode will be allowed. Otherwise, an error message will be logged and "
"sent to the ground control station indicating that mode entry has been "
"prohibited."
msgstr ""
"若 :ref:`SID_AXIS<SID_AXIS>` "
"非零，则下次参数刷新后该模式相关参数将可见，并允许进入该模式。否则，将记录错误消息并发送到地面站，表明禁止进入该模式。"

